1
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,159
Mu Ying!

2
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,560
What did you do to Mu Ying?!

3
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:12,840
Jiang Huai.

4
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,519
You only have the burn time of an incense stick.

5
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:19,480
Find the vault's location in the book.

6
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,799
If you dare call the police,

7
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,159
I'll kill Mu Ying before time is up.

8
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:35,840
Mu Ying

9
00:02:04,719 --> 00:02:05,519
The Old Newsvendor

10
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:08,439
Are you crazy? You dare tie me up?

11
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,800
I didn't want to hurt you,

12
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:15,000
but you kept hounding me.

13
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,280
Aren't you supposed to be so resourceful?

14
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,039
Poison gas will be released soon.

15
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,919
You won't last long.

16
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,039
I wonder if Jiang Huai

17
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,800
will solve the riddle in time.

18
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:29,159
Inspector Mu,

19
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:31,840
just enjoy yourself.

20
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,080
Don't go! Don't go!

21
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,120
Don't let me catch you!

22
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,039
Master,

23
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:42,520
let's get out of here.

24
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,080
This Lijia Town is too scary.

25
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,080
We almost died here.

26
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:45,960
No.

27
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:47,400
I have to save Mu Ying first.

28
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,319
Tell me the truth.

29
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,280
Why are you helping me?

30
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,240
Isn't it obvious?

31
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,039
Because my Master likes you.

32
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,319
Master!

33
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:03,400
What are you doing?

34
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:07,560
Wake up, Bookworm!

35
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,840
Master! Bookworm!

36
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:11,199
Master, wake up!

37
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,599
Master!

38
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,759
Master!

39
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:16,400
Look out!

40
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:25,639
Mu Ying has saved me so many times.

41
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,479
I absolutely can't leave her behind.

42
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,000
If you want to leave,

43
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,080
leave by yourself.

44
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:32,199
If you're not leaving,

45
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,199
then neither am I.

46
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:34,960
I was just a stinking beggar anyway.

47
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,599
You saved me by teaching me storytelling.

48
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:38,560
Old man,

49
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,840
I'll fight you to the death!

50
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:41,680
Rascal,

51
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:42,800
Well done!

52
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:43,960
Come,

53
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,400
write down everything I'm about to say.

54
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,080
Okay.

55
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,280
We can't just sit here and wait to die.

56
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:52,240
We need to find a way out, fast.

57
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:03,599
Open the door!

58
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,240
It's not heat-activated.

59
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,279
Nor is it written in white vinegar.

60
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,160
Why doesn't this book

61
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,480
have any clues to the vault's location?

62
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,959
Maybe this book

63
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,040
doesn't have the vault's location at all.

64
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,480
The old man is bluffing.

65
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,079
Jiang Huai!

66
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,879
You've already wasted 30 minutes.

67
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,800
The second wave of poison gas is coming!

68
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:56,800
Old man!

69
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,240
Don't go, old man!

70
00:04:58,759 --> 00:04:59,279
Old man!

71
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,040
What could this be?

72
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:24,240
Master.

73
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,000
Master!

74
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:26,079
There's a seal here.

75
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:27,920
A seal?

76
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,920
Fire Qilin.

77
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,759
It's a Late Qing Prince's collection mark.

78
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:36,439
Qilin...

79
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,160
Fire Qilin.

80
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,360
Fire Qilin.

81
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:40,959
Fire...

82
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,399
I get it!

83
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,360
Master!

84
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,600
Did you find a clue?

85
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,120
The cipher for the vault's location...

86
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,639
shouldn't be too complicated.

87
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:55,680
It must be hidden within this mark.

88
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:58,720
This Qilin is the address.

89
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:01,639
The Fire Qilin is a mythical sacred beast.

90
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:03,399
It represents fortune and prosperity.

91
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,519
And it also represents treasure.

92
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,920
But this book is all about crafting methods.

93
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,079
There's no mention of a Qilin at all.

94
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:12,000
The Fire Qilin is just a hint.

95
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:14,279
What matters most is the word "fire."

96
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,240
In the book Heavenly Craftsmanship,

97
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,240
the sections that mention fire

98
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,279
are metallurgy

99
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,399
and casting techniques.

100
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:21,600
Look.

101
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:22,959
I was right.

102
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,240
"Whenever exposed to intense fire,

103
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,040
one quarter will be consumed."

104
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,319
This character for "four"...

105
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,279
is bolder than the regular text.

106
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,399
Write it down quickly.

107
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,600
Okay.

108
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,279
I get it.

109
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,959
If a sentence mentions "fire,"

110
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:48,879
any bolded character in it

111
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,000
is part of the vault's address.

112
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,839
"Apply external fire."

113
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,879
The "hua" in "carbonize its oil and wax,"

114
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:56,600
is also bolded.

115
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,000
Sihua Street, North Alley

116
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:15,439
Exactly.

117
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,600
Sihua Street, North Alley

118
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,720
is the location of the vault.

119
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:22,800
Old man!

120
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:23,800
Old man!

121
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:24,759
Come out!

122
00:07:25,079 --> 00:07:26,120
We found the address!

123
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:30,079
Take the book.

124
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,560
Old man!

125
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:39,920
We found it.

126
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:41,959
Speak.

127
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:43,920
Tell me now!

128
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,920
Where is the vault located?

129
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,600
Let Mu Ying go first,

130
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,399
then I'll tell you the vault's location.

131
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:55,079
If anything happens to her,

132
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,160
for as long as you live,

133
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,240
you'll never get the vault's address.

134
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,879
You think I'm negotiating with you?
